### Criar um aluno
POST http://localhost:3000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Silva",
  "number": 12345
}

### Criar outro aluno
POST http://localhost:3000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rui Costa",
  "number": 54321
}

### Dados inválidos (deve dar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "number": "abc"
}

### Listar todos
GET http://localhost:3000/students

### Listar com limite
GET http://localhost:3000/students?limit=1

### Ver um aluno
GET http://localhost:3000/students/1

### Aluno que não existe (deve dar 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/students/99